- id: reference-framework title: Reference Framework instruction: Provide context through references and competitive analysis sections: - id: inspiration-games title: Inspiration Games sections: - id: primary-references title: Primary References type: numbered-list repeatable: true template: | **{{reference_game}}** - {{what_we_learn_from_it}} - id: competitive-analysis title: Competitive Analysis template: | **Direct Competitors:**
- {{competitor_1}}: {{strengths_and_weaknesses}} - {{competitor_2}}: {{strengths_and_weaknesses}}
